{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1783262486920,"sessionID":"ses_0cd472f27ffebPkD0hfqyhYco6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_00_kmUpL8h3q51L8Tqb7Mbq9178","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/yt/task/pc-lib-analysis/runs/pc-lib-3456/complex-float64-base-mul/2026-07-05T14-13-33-171Z/blocks/function_summary.json","content":"{
  "summary": "stdlib 数值计算生态中一个极小粒度的子包，提供双精度复数（Complex128）的乘法运算。包含三个入口：标准 `mul(z1, z2)` 接收两个 Complex128 对象返回乘积；`mul.assign()` 将实部和虚部分别写入输出数组；`mul.strided()` 操作跨步内存视图。纯 JavaScript 实现，同时提供 C 原生实现并通过 Node.js N-API 编译为 addon 以提升性能。面向数值计算/科学计算的 JavaScript 与 C 开发者。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "双精度复数乘法",
      "description": "两个 Complex128 双精度复数相乘，结果规约为 z = (a*c - b*d) + (a*d + b*c)i",
      "evidence": ["lib/main.js:46-53", "src/main.c:46-60"]
    },
    {
      "name": "跨步数组视图乘算",
      "description": "支持从 strided Float64Array 视图中读取实部/虚部并写入输出数组，适用于批量 SIMD 风格数据布局",
      "evidence": ["lib/strided.js:46-53", "lib/assign.js:41-44"]
    },
    {
      "name": "C 原生扩展",
      "description": "通过 node-gyp (binding.gyp) 将 C 实现编译为 .node addon，提供 N-API 二进制接口，可 native.js 按需加载",
      "evidence": ["binding.gyp", "src/addon.c:19-22", "lib/native.js:46-48"]
    }
  ],
  "domain": "数值计算",
  "target_users": "JavaScript 与 C 数值计算/科学计算开发者"
}
